artifacts.en_desc:
Merges two different commanders and has access to all their uniques, but the target defense scales much faster! 
- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
{f.high}The possible commanders are randomized every run.{f.endhigh}

